<rml>
<head>
    <title>Lua to RmlUi event sample</title>
    <style>
        body {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #090e18e8;
            color: white;
            font-family: "Bitstream Vera Sans";
        }

        .panel {
            width: 760px;
            padding: 38px;
            background: #0d1727f2;
            border: 1px #36516f;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #dff7ff;
            font-size: 34px;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 30px 0;
            color: #8fa9bf;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        button {
            width: 270px;
            height: 76px;
            margin: 0 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: white;
            font-family: "Bitstream Vera Sans";
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        #trigger-button {
            background: #17689d;
            border: 2px #54c9ff;
        }

        #trigger-button:hover {
            background: #2186c5;
        }

        #trigger-button:active {
            background: #0d4c78;
            transform: scale(0.97);
        }

        #target-state {
            display: none;
        }

        #target-button {
            background: #242b38;
            border: 2px #596477;
            color: #93a0b4;
            transition: background-color 0.22s, border-color 0.22s, color 0.22s, transform 0.22s;
        }

        #target-button .online {
            display: none;
        }

        #target-state:checked + #target-button {
            background: #087c62;
            border-color: #58ffd1;
            color: #eafff9;
            box-shadow: 0 0 28px #21e9b477;
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        #target-state:checked + #target-button .standby {
            display: none;
        }

        #target-state:checked + #target-button .online {
            display: inline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="panel">
        <h1>Lua → RmlUi event</h1>
        <p>The left button asks Lua to dispatch a native click to the hidden RmlUi state control.</p>
        <div class="controls">
            <button id="trigger-button" onclick="ToggleTarget">Toggle target</button>
            <input id="target-state" type="checkbox" />
            <button id="target-button">
                <span class="standby">TARGET · STANDBY</span>
                <span class="online">TARGET · ONLINE</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
